            "value": "%@ tema önizlemesi. 90'ların sonu konsol enerjisi: iki ayrıntılı yarış arabası, iki parlak kask, ışıl ışıl bir çarpışma ve koyu asfalt üzerinde elektrik mavisi bir pist."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Podgląd motywu %@. Energia konsol z końca lat 90.: dwa szczegółowe auta, dwa lśniące kaski, jasna kraksa i elektryzujący akwamarynowy tor na ciemnym asfalcie."
          }
        },
        "es-MX": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vista previa del tema %@. Energía de consola de finales de los noventa: dos carros detallados, dos cascos brillantes, un choque luminoso y un circuito aguamarina eléctrico sobre asfalto oscuro."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "settings_theme_gallery_preview_accessibility_sixty_four_bit": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "ca": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Previsualització del tema %@. Curses de consola low-poly: dos cotxes facetats, dos cascos esculpits, un xoc explosiu i un circuit aqua de neó sobre asfalt nocturn."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vorschau für das %@-Theme. Low-Poly-Konsolenrennen: zwei kantige Rennwagen, zwei modellierte Helme, ein explosiver Crash und eine neon-aquafarbene Strecke auf nachtdunklem Asphalt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ theme preview. Low-poly console racing: two faceted racers, two sculpted helmets, an explosive crash, and a neon aqua circuit over midnight asphalt."
          }
        },
        "en-AU": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ theme preview. Low-poly console racing: two faceted racers, two sculpted helmets, an explosive crash, and a neon aqua circuit over midnight asphalt."
          }
        },
        "en-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ theme preview. Low-poly console racing: two faceted racers, two sculpted helmets, an explosive crash, and a neon aqua circuit over midnight asphalt."
          }
        },
        "en-GB": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%@ theme preview. Low-poly console racing: two faceted racers, two sculpted helmets, an explosive crash, and a neon aqua circuit over midnight asphalt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vista previa del tema %@. Carreras de consola low-poly: dos coches facetados, dos cascos esculpidos, un choque explosivo y un circuito aguamarina de neón sobre asfalto nocturno."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Aperçu du thème %@. Course sur console en low-poly : deux bolides facettés, deux casques sculptés, un crash explosif et un circuit aqua néon sur un asphalte nocturne."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Anteprima del tema %@. Corse su console low-poly: due auto sfaccettate, due caschi scolpiti, uno schianto esplosivo e un circuito acquamarina al neon sull’asfalto notturno."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Themapreview voor %@. Low-poly consoleracen: twee gefacetteerde racewagens, twee gevormde helmen, een explosieve crash en een neon-aquakleurig circuit op nachtelijk asfalt."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%@テーマのプレビュー。ローポリのコンソールレース。多面体のレーサー2台、造形されたヘルメット2つ、爆発的なクラッシュ、真夜中のアスファルトを走るネオンアクアのサーキット。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%@ 테마 미리보기. 로우 폴리 콘솔 레이싱: 각진 레이서 두 대, 조형된 헬멧 두 개, 폭발적인 충돌, 한밤중 아스팔트 위 네온 아쿠아 서킷."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Prévia do tema %@. Corrida de console low-poly: dois carros facetados, dois capacetes esculpidos, uma batida explosiva e um circuito azul-água neon sobre asfalto noturno."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%@ 主題預覽。低多邊形主機賽車：兩台稜角賽車、兩頂立體頭盔、爆炸般的撞擊效果，以及午夜柏油上的霓虹水藍賽道。"
          }
        },
        "pt-PT": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Pré-visualização do tema %@. Corridas de consola low-poly: dois carros facetados, dois capacetes esculpidos, um embate explosivo e um circuito azul-água néon sobre asfalto noturno."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%@ 主题预览。低多边形主机赛车：两辆棱角赛车、两顶立体头盔、爆炸般的碰撞效果，以及午夜沥青上的霓虹水蓝赛道。"
          }
        },
        "fr-CA": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Aperçu du thème %@. Course sur console en low-poly : deux bolides facettés, deux casques sculptés, un crash explosif et un circuit aqua néon sur un asphalte nocturne."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%@ tema önizlemesi. Düşük poligonlu konsol yarışı: iki köşeli yarış arabası, iki şekillendirilmiş kask, patlayıcı bir çarpışma ve gece asfaltı üzerinde neon su mavisi bir pist."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Podgląd motywu %@. Konsolowe wyścigi low-poly: dwa kanciaste auta, dwa rzeźbione kaski, wybuchowa kraksa i neonowy akwamarynowy tor na nocnym asfalcie."
          }
        },
        "es-MX": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Vista previa del tema %@. Carreras de consola low-poly: dos carros facetados, dos cascos esculpidos, un choque explosivo y un circuito aguamarina de neón sobre asfalto nocturno."
          }
        }
      }
    },
